            {
               "type": 1,
               "uuid": "3874d1e8-0f76-4432-9ee2-d8c8c9dccf53",
               "text": "Equipe History Tracers — Contando",
               "page": "https://www.historytracers.org/index.html?page=class_content&arg=3874d1e8-0f76-4432-9ee2-d8c8c9dccf53",
               "date_time": {
                  "type": "gregory",
                  "year": "2024",
                  "month": "",
                  "day": ""
               }
            }
         ],
         "text": [
            {
               "text": "#### Dividindo Novamente\n\nAgora imagine que cortamos esse mesmo papel e o entregamos a uma única pessoa, considerando não apenas as mãos, mas o corpo inteiro. Como há apenas uma pessoa para recebê-lo, ela fica com o papel inteiro: nada é compartilhado.",
               "source": null,
               "date_time": null,
               "isTable": false,
               "imgdesc": "",
               "format": "markdown",
               "PostMention": ""
            },
            {
               "text": "<p><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"80 18 340 220\" width=\"100%\"><g fill=\"#ADD8E6\" stroke=\"none\"><rect x=\"105\" y=\"25\" width=\"20\" height=\"85\"/><rect x=\"135\" y=\"25\" width=\"20\" height=\"85\"/><rect x=\"165\" y=\"25\" width=\"20\" height=\"85\"/><rect x=\"195\" y=\"25\" width=\"20\" height=\"85\"/><rect x=\"225\" y=\"25\" width=\"20\" height=\"85\"/><rect x=\"255\" y=\"25\" width=\"20\" height=\"85\"/><rect x=\"285\" y=\"25\" width=\"20\" height=\"85\"/><rect x=\"315\" y=\"25\" width=\"20\" height=\"85\"/><rect x=\"345\" y=\"25\" width=\"20\" height=\"85\"/><rect x=\"375\" y=\"25\" width=\"20\" height=\"85\"/></g><g transform=\"translate(202,130) scale(4.0)\" fill=\"#8D6E63\" stroke=\"none\"><path d=\"M12,0.5A2.5,2.5 0 1,1 12,5.5A2.5,2.5 0 1,1 12,0.5Z\"/><path d=\"M11,5.5L13,5.5L13,6.5L11,6.5Z\"/><path d=\"M8.5,6.5L15.5,6.5L14.5,14L9.5,14Z\"/><path d=\"M8.5,7L6,11.5L6.7,12L9,8.5Z\"/><path d=\"M15.5,7L18,11.5L17.3,12L15,8.5Z\"/><path d=\"M10,14L9.5,20.5L11,20.5L11.5,14Z\"/><path d=\"M14,14L14.5,20.5L13,20.5L12.5,14Z\"/></g></svg></p>",
               "source": null,
               "date_time": null,
               "isTable": false,
               "imgdesc": "Dez retângulos verticais e uma pessoa, representando os dez objetos entregues a uma única pessoa.",
               "format": "html",
               "PostMention": ""
